{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure Jampilation</strong>\u00a0is an anthology of the short point-and-click adventure games I made throughout the years in various<i>\u00a0game jams</i>, events where participants try to make a game from scratch in a short amount of time, often following a surprise theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The collection includes the following games:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Halloween Party (2020)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made in 14 days for the $104 Adventure Game Challenge</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duty First (2020)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made in 14 days for AdvXJam 2020</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nebraska Smith and the Mask of Minkhamanna (2021)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made in 14 days for Adventure Jam 2021</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mutiny on the Clodia (2021)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made in 14 days for the $105 Adventure Game Challenge</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Will of Arthur Flabbington (jam version) (2021)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made in 14 days for AdvXJam 2021</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Where Wolf? (2022)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made in 14 days for Adventure Jam 2022</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Rest for the Wicked (2023)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made in 14 days for Adventure Jam 2023</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dinner at the Gugas (2024)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made in 7 days for PowerJam #1</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Death of Fo-gu (2024)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made in 14 days for the $108 Adventure Game Challenge</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eulogy for Nonno (2025)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made in 14 days for the $109 Adventure Game Challenge</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>...and more to come in the future!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All games available in English and Italian except: The Halloween Party (English only), Duty First (English Only), No Rest for the Wicked (English, Italian, German, Spanish and French), Dinner at the Gugas (English only).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Delusional","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4096750/480b807a35e3055cc7975c17bcd7ea6f2235a40f.jpg"},{"name":"Limbo time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4096750/d4783e1da8dcb6bcda1e2f6fc163796538b75cc9.jpg"},{"name":"Moved on","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4096750/35b15268b4fcf851b3e61a75bb784bb1c046e0b3.jpg"},{"name":"Metal is life","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4096750/b89cb1f18419eb68e29de876418e3b5eff568e01.jpg"},{"name":"The Mask","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4096750/fcc316afc8b0a25fda2f52a79d8dac79f094c744.jpg"},{"name":"Bye bye Clodia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4096750/852398df25850ff759a5ebd7c6c222648d4ab83e.jpg"},{"name":"The s\u00e9ance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4096750/2494b49660cb762cb9c3d4c3f0958645308aadea.jpg"},{"name":"Wolf hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4096750/f